# Item 4 — hybrid ground-up vault rebuild (party brainstorm)

**Date:** 2026-07-02  
**Party batch:** `deleg_481f8c63` (Odysseus · Clio · Iris addenda when land)

## Hermes recommendation

**Hybrid, party-led rebuild** — primary sources as spine; current vault = salvage inventory; agents re-author, not bulk migrate.

| Approach | Risk |
|----------|------|
| Keep all seeding | Smoke entities, weak cites, agent false confidence |
| Full wipe | Lose ~42 capture/concepts + ~46 capabilities with USAspending logic |
| **Hybrid** | Rebuild from Shipley + KBR URLs + templates; KEEP only manifest-approved pages |

Scale today: ~23 Shipley, ~46 capabilities, ~42 concepts under `global/`.

