## Party “remember and create clean”

Each specialist re-reads **sources + manifest**, writes new trusted pages (or candidates). Hermes orchestrates waves; Hephaestus schema/lint/archive moves; no Hermes vault body edits.

## Phases

0. Freeze promotes · 1. Manifest (party parallel) · 2. Archive smoke to `generated-projections/archived/rebuild-2026/` · 3. `ariadne-vault-schema.md` · 4. Wave A KBR capabilities · 5. Wave B Shipley · 6. Wave C concept salvage · 7. Templates one-at-a-time · 8. Lint green → then item 3 edit

## Salvage rule (per page)

Primary source still true? Cited & non-duplicate? Used in retrieve/INDEX? **3/3 KEEP** · **2/3 REWRITE** · **≤1 ARCHIVE**. Concepts: bias KEEP review if term is in capture OS vocabulary.

## Overwatch picks

1. Hybrid yes/no · 2. Archive path OK · 3. First wave A/B/C · 4. Minimal vs full cleanse

